{
"markdown": "### 5Row\n\nAdds a convenient 5th row of number keys right on the iPhone's native keyboard, for faster and smoother typing.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/5Row/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/5Row/Screenshots/2.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 8,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Fixed number row:** Adds a separate number row above the default keyboard with a native iOS look.\n- **Smart character switching:** Press Shift or 123 to change the number row into commonly used punctuation.\n- **Rename keys freely:** Lets you edit the display labels for the ABC and 123 keys (up to 5 characters).\n- **Advanced features (Pro):** Freely customize 10 characters across both key rows, adjust the keyboard height and enable the always-show 5 rows mode.\n- **Flexible management:** Supports excluding individual apps (Blacklist), quick on/off and resetting to default settings with 1 tap.\n- **Note:** Only supports the vertical system keyboard on iPhone; third-party keyboards are not supported.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
